<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on the stg/mark exchange rate.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on the stg/mark exchange rate.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein has issued 25 million American-style call and put warrants, in five equal tranches, on the sterling/mark exchange rate, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 10.JUL.97-16.MAR.98   PAYDATE	09.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  2.9392 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	   STRIKE	 ISSUE     PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	   2.90 DEM     7.64 DEM  1.27 PCT    38.47 X</p>
<p> CALL	   3.00 DEM     3.88 DEM  3.39 PCT    75.75 X</p>
<p> PUT	    2.80 DEM     5.54 DEM  6.62 PCT    53.05 X</p>
<p> PUT	    2.85 DEM     7.63 DEM  5.63 PCT    38.52 X</p>
<p> PUT	    2.90 DEM     10.45 DEM 4.89 PCT    28.13 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
